<p><%= t('about.story') %></p>
<h2>What you can do here</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Browse the gallery.</strong> Thousands of original premade designs across every major style — animals, blackwork, traditional, realism, lettering and more. Every design is sold with the finished full-color artwork and the clean linework a tattoo artist stencils from. Start in the <a href="/gallery">gallery</a> or see what other people love most on the <a href="/top-loved">Top Loved</a> page.</li>
  <li><strong>Order a design drawn just for you.</strong> The <a href="/orders/custom">custom desk</a> draws one-of-one designs to order — 50% deposit, delivered in 48 hours. The full walkthrough is in our <a href="/guides/custom-design-process">custom design guide</a>.</li>
  <li><strong>Put your design on merch.</strong> Any design you own can become a tee or a poster through <a href="/merch">Mike's Custom Tees</a>, and kids' drawings can become merchandise too through <a href="/doodle-to-tattoo">Doodle to Tattoo</a>.</li>
  <li><strong>Watch the art happen.</strong> Designs from this catalog are featured on our shows — see them on the <a href="/show-designs">As Seen on Color With Us</a> page and the <a href="/watch">Watch</a> page.</li>
</ul>
<h2>More from the studio</h2>
<p>Tattoo Art Customs is one room of the Useful Appz house — <a href="/worlds">our worlds</a> page maps them all. The same studio makes <a href="/apps">apps</a> (Chorvix, the AI bars, and the rest of the toolbox), runs the kids' coloring world <strong>Little Inkers</strong> and the <strong>Poppy &amp; Ziggy</strong> cartoon behind a strict kid-safe wall, and publishes free <a href="/guides">tattoo guides</a> — aftercare, choosing a design that ages well, and how the custom process works. Everything is built and run in-house in Abbeville, Louisiana.</p>
